  // block geometries, and a type the table has no entry for contributes ZERO
  // bytes. so a file whose weights are all a fork's own type reads as almost
  // massless: prism's PQ2_0 came back at 0.017 bpw against the 2.13 its card
  // states, ik_llama's `_R4` rungs at 0.113, and unsloth's Q1_0 kimi k3 at
